%% AegisFlight — one telemetry tick through the system
sequenceDiagram
    participant Sim as FlightSimulator
    participant Atk as Attack
    participant Enc as MavlinkEncoder
    participant Dec as MavlinkDecoder
    participant Ext as FeatureExtractor
    participant Det as Detectors (4)
    participant Fus as FusionEngine
    participant Log as EventStore
    participant API as Backend/WS

    Sim->>Atk: FlightState (clean truth)
    Atk->>Atk: perturb_state() (GPS spoof / telemetry manip)
    Atk->>Enc: (possibly modified) FlightState
    Enc->>Enc: encode 6 msg types + sensor noise
    Atk->>Enc: before_encode() (seq scramble)
    Enc->>Atk: RawPacket[]
    Atk->>Dec: perturb_packets() (drop/dup/inject/reid)
    Dec->>Ext: MessageEnvelope[] (update())
    Note over Ext: every decision tick (5 Hz):
    Ext->>Det: FeatureFrame (extract())
    Det->>Fus: DetectorResult x4 (score, votes, evidence)
    Fus->>Fus: noisy-OR combine + attribute + severity
    Fus->>Log: ThreatAssessment (if is_alert)
    Fus->>API: ThreatAssessment (broadcast)
    API->>API: WebSocket push {telemetry, threat}
